WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.130
A detected pattern is a starting point for

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:05.930
review. Check the market and timeframe,
then open

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:07.150
Scanner beneath the chart.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:08.490
Choose one result.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.690
Read its name and direction, then turn on

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.230
Patterns to inspect the available chart
overlay.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.670
Compare the marked candles with the
surrounding structure.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.770
A pattern score is a review cue, not

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:21.490
a win probability.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.670
Look for evidence that could contradict
the idea.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.430
Record what supports the pattern and what
remains

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:31.170
unclear. Bring that question to your
lesson before making assumptions.

